SUMMARY:Shamanic Full Moon Ceremony
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nHunter’s Moon\n\nFollowing the Tracks t
 o Your Spirit Animal\n\nUnder the Hunter’s Moon\, we will follow the sig
 ns within and around us to meet a spirit animal guide and receive the wisd
 om\, protection\, healing\, or encouragement it offers for the season ahea
 d.\n\nThe ceremony will include:\n\n• Opening sacred space and calling t
 he seven directions\n• Reflection on the medicine of the Hunter’s Moon
 \n• A guided journey to meet your spirit animal\n• Questions and guida
 nce from your animal ally\n• Intention-setting for the coming lunar cycl
 e\n• Optional sharing in a respectful witnessing circle\n• Closing wit
 h gratitude and blessing\n\nNo prior meditation or shamanic journeying exp
 erience is needed. You remain in control throughout\, and sharing is alway
 s optional.\n\nWhat to bring\n\n• Blanket\, yoga mat\, or comfortable pl
 ace to rest\n• Journal and pen\n• Water\n• A small natural object fo
 r the altar\, if desired\n\nBring appropriate crystals that you would like
  charged. The best crystals to charge during a full moon are amethyst\, sm
 oky quartz\, citrine\, black selenite\, and obsidian. We will be outside (
 unless it rains) so please dress for the weather.\n\nPlenty of parking ava
 ilable\, you will need a gate code coming in the community. Also cell phon
 e service is spotty. This event is advertised on multiple forums.\n\nThis 
 is a laid-back event on our property\, I hope that you can join us. If you
  have any safety concerns\, please give me a call and we can work through 
 them.\n\nSee you then!\nShaman Phil
