SUMMARY:Shamanic Shakti Activation Ceremony
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nJoin us at Sanctuary Studio for a lovingl
 y held\, deep energetic transmission designed to awaken your innate life f
 orce\, dissolve subtle energetic blocks\, and align you with your highest 
 calling.\n\nThis is a completely passive experience and requires no effort
  on the part of participants. Participants in past ceremonies have experie
 nced spontaneous bodily movements and mudras (kriyas)\, somatic/emotional 
 release\, vocal and light language activations\, feeling the energy coursi
 ng through their system\, visionary experiences\, past life regressions\, 
 visitations from spirit guides and ancestors\, instant manifestations and 
 more.\n\nThis container will be held by the dedicated divine union duo of 
 Sàmą Luž and Sėnėn Mea. Together\, we weave a high-vibrational field 
 supported by the Light of Christ\, Saint Neem Karoli Baba\, the Master Pla
 nt Doctors (including Noya Rao\, the "Tree of Light")\, and our star famil
 y and healed ancestor lineages.\n\nPlease bring a comfortable mat\, water\
 , journal\, blanket and eye mask (optional). We advise arriving with a lig
 ht stomach but not starving (last large meal 2.5 hours prior or a lighter 
 meal/snack 1.5 hours prior).\n\nLocation: Sanctuary Studio 81 Weaverville 
 Rd.\, Asheville NC\nEnergy Exchange: Donations welcomed\nPlease contact S
 àmą Luž with any questions and to confirm your attendance: 714-743-5677
